  (text "MCU: STM32G0B1KBU6 (UFQFPN-32). Pin use (datasheet DS13560 alternate-function tables):\nPA11 (pin 22) FDCAN1_RX AF3, PA12 (pin 23) FDCAN1_TX AF3 (leave the PA11/PA12 -> PA9/PA10 remap off).\nPA2 (pin 9) USART2_TX AF1, PA3 (pin 10) USART2_RX AF1: the puck.  PA9 (pin 19) USART1_TX AF1, PA10 (pin 21) USART1_RX AF1: debug (J4, also the ROM bootloader UART).\nPA0 (pin 7) ADC1_IN0: slot ID.  PA5 (pin 12): LED.  PC14 (pin 2) OSC_IN: 8 MHz oscillator, HSE bypass (no OSC_OUT on this package); PC15 unused.  PA13 SWDIO, PA14 SWCLK (BOOT0 shares it), PF2 = NRST." (at 170 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6afda5ad-4335-59a8-ac44-00143173e4bf"))
