  (text "GPS PUCK: J2, JST PH 4-pin side entry (S4B-PH-K), same pinout as the main board's J6: 1 puck power, 2 TX (out, to the puck's RX), 3 RX (in, from the puck's TX), 4 GND.\nPuck power: 3.3 V or 5 V by JP1 (1-2 bridged = 3.3 V as delivered; cut it and bridge 2-3 for 5 V), through a 0.2 A PTC. 100 R in series on TX and RX, USBLC6-2SC6 (low capacitance) on TX, RX and the supply." (at 170 200 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7d06e4f1-843f-5cd7-8c3a-9f1141f87e39"))
